{"evalSetVersion":"chat-quality-v1","runId":"2026-04-26T12-09-25-773Z","evalMode":"pilot","runStartedAt":"2026-04-26T12:09:25.774Z","rowStartedAt":"2026-04-26T12:09:38.779Z","baseURL":"https://kabuyomi-api.dznqjmctk7.workers.dev","deviceKey":"eval-chat-quality-v1","appVersion":"b42cdb1","ticker":"GOOGL","filingKey":"v6:0001652044:000165204426000018","questionId":"GOOGL-06","question":"リスク要因を3つ挙げて","intent":"risk_factors","expectedFocus":["広告市場","規制/訴訟","AI競争"],"answer":"Alphabet Inc.の主要なリスク要因として、競争の激化、広告収入への依存、および規制や独占禁止法への対応が挙げられます。これらは、市場シェアの低下や、法的な制約による事業運営への影響を及ぼす可能性があります。\n\n根拠として、提出資料のリスクカテゴリーにこれらの項目が含まれていることが確認できます。なお、これらのリスクが具体的にどの程度の金額で業績に影響したかという数値的な詳細は、今回の資料では確認できません。","sources":[{"sourceId":"S8","sourceKind":"sec_filing","sourceStrength":"filing_primary","sectionType":"md_a","sourceLabel":"10-K Item 7, filed 2026-02-05","excerpt":"We do not intend our use or display of other companies' trade names or trademarks to imply an endorsement or sponsorship of us by such companies, or any relationship with any of these companies. PART I ITEM 1. BUSINESS O","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1652044/000165204426000018/goog-20251231.htm"}],"responsePath":"gemini","modelName":"gemma-4-31b-it","fallbackReason":null,"promptTokenCount":null,"sourceCount":1,"latencyMs":4537,"creditsCharged":2,"creditsRemaining":376,"creditBillingEnabled":true,"usageCredits":{"monthlyRemaining":0,"monthlyLimit":30,"purchasedRemaining":376,"totalRemaining":376,"resetsAt":"2026-05-01T00:00:00+09:00"},"answerRating":null,"failureLabelsObserved":[],"notes":""}
{"evalSetVersion":"chat-quality-v1","runId":"2026-04-26T12-09-25-773Z","evalMode":"pilot","runStartedAt":"2026-04-26T12:09:25.774Z","rowStartedAt":"2026-04-26T12:09:43.316Z","baseURL":"https://kabuyomi-api.dznqjmctk7.workers.dev","deviceKey":"eval-chat-quality-v1","appVersion":"b42cdb1","ticker":"GOOGL","filingKey":"v6:0001652044:000165204426000018","questionId":"GOOGL-07","question":"成長リスクは？","intent":"risk_factors","expectedFocus":["AI検索変化","広告需要","規制"],"answer":"Alphabet Inc.の成長リスクとして、競争の激化、広告収入への過度な依存、規制や独占禁止法への対応、プライバシーとデータ保護、AIなどの技術転換への対応、そしてコンテンツプラットフォームの運営に伴うリスクが挙げられます。\n\nこれらは、サービスの利用者が減少したり、法的な制約でビジネスモデルが制限されたりすることで、将来的な成長や収益に影響を与える可能性があります。根拠として、これらの項目がリスク要因として特定されています。\n\n現時点で、これらのリスクが具体的な数値として業績にどのような影響を与えたかは、提供された資料の中では確認できません。","sources":[{"sourceId":"S8","sourceKind":"sec_filing","sourceStrength":"filing_primary","sectionType":"md_a","sourceLabel":"10-K Item 7, filed 2026-02-05","excerpt":"We do not intend our use or display of other companies' trade names or trademarks to imply an endorsement or sponsorship of us by such companies, or any relationship with any of these companies. PART I ITEM 1. BUSINESS O","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1652044/000165204426000018/goog-20251231.htm"}],"responsePath":"gemini","modelName":"gemma-4-31b-it","fallbackReason":null,"promptTokenCount":null,"sourceCount":1,"latencyMs":5171,"creditsCharged":2,"creditsRemaining":374,"creditBillingEnabled":true,"usageCredits":{"monthlyRemaining":0,"monthlyLimit":30,"purchasedRemaining":374,"totalRemaining":374,"resetsAt":"2026-05-01T00:00:00+09:00"},"answerRating":null,"failureLabelsObserved":[],"notes":""}
